{"articleNo":"73895","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=73895&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제 7기 방학 중 교육기부 지식봉사 보고서 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.15","hit":"6559","attachments":[{"name":"최종활동보고서.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=73895&attachNo=2336"},{"name":"활동완료자 명단.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=73895&attachNo=2361"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">제 7기 한국장학재단 방학 중 교육기부 지식봉사 보고서 제출 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 참여학생 : 제 7기 지식봉사 신청자만 제출 가능(해당자는 개별 문자 발송)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 최종활동보고서[붙임1]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 활동완료자 명단[붙임2]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 봉사인증서(각 해당 봉사기관에서 발급받을 것)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 제출기간 : 2013. 3. 4(월)까지 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 제출방법 : 직접제출 및 등기제출(3월 4일 도착분까지 접수됨)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 직접제출 : 금오공과대학교 학생처(본관 101호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 등기제출 : (730-701) 경북 구미시 대학로 61 금오공과대학교 학생처(본관 101호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;※ 활동완료자 명단[붙임2]은 </span><a href=\"mailto:jykim88228@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">jykim88228@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> (메일로 제출)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 봉사활동기간 : 2012. 12. ~ 2013. 2.(3개월간), 주말 및 평일 방과 후</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 봉사시간 : 최소 6시간 ~ 최대 30시간 기준</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 지원금 : 270,000원(최대 30시간 기준)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;※ 지원금은 시간당 9,000원으로 활동인증시간에 따라 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;※ 6시간 미만 활동자는 지원금 없음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;※ 30시간 초과하여 봉사한 참여자는 30시간에 대한 지원금을 지급하되,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 초과한 시간까지 봉사인증서 발급가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ex) 35시간 봉사자는 270,000원 지급하고, 35시간 봉사인증서 발급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;※ 지원금은 3월 중 지급예정(지급 전에 학생 개별문자 발송 예정)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">8. 참여자 인센티브</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 지도자급 멘토링(KorMent) 등 인재육성지원사업 참여 자격 부여</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 한국장학재단 이사장 명의 멘토링인증서 발급 및 지원금 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ※ 멘토링인증서는 한국장학재단 회원가입이 되어 있는 경우 발급이 가능하며,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 모든 활동종료 후 봉사넷(</span><a href=\"http://korment.kosaf.go.kr/\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">http://korment.kosaf.go.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">)에서 일괄 발급 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">9. 문 의 처</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;한국장학재단 02-2259-2645, 콜센터 1599-2000</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 학생처 478-7065</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 최종활동보고서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 활동완료자 명단 1부.</span>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 1. 15.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">학 생 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
